### §9. Compact the stress collection log.
### After many inserts/updates/deletes the log file grows. Compaction rewrites
### it to contain only the current live state, speeding up future restarts.
POST http://localhost:1538/snapshot
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{}

